{"seq":3,"slug":"latent-space","title":"隐空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations/latent-space","wordCount":1918,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"隐空间\">隐空间</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>隐空间（Latent Space）是生成模型中连接随机噪声与数据样本的中间表示空间。在 VAE 中，编码器将数据映射到隐空间中的分布，解码器从隐空间采样生成数据；在 GAN 中，生成器将隐空间中的随机向量变换为数据样本；在扩散模型中，Latent Diffusion 在隐空间而非像素空间执行去噪过程。隐空间的结构和几何特性直接决定了生成模型的质量、可控性和泛化能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[数据空间 x] --&gt; B[编码器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[隐空间 z]&#10;    C --&gt; D[解码器]&#10;    D --&gt; E[重构/生成]&#10;    C --&gt; F{语义属性}&#10;    F --&gt; G[方向 1: 表情]&#10;    F --&gt; H[方向 2: 年龄]&#10;    F --&gt; I[方向 3: 光照]\">graph LR\n    A[数据空间 x] --&gt; B[编码器]\n    B --&gt; C[隐空间 z]\n    C --&gt; D[解码器]\n    D --&gt; E[重构/生成]\n    C --&gt; F{语义属性}\n    F --&gt; G[方向 1: 表情]\n    F --&gt; H[方向 2: 年龄]\n    F --&gt; I[方向 3: 光照]</pre><p>隐空间的核心价值在于降维和语义组织。高维数据空间中的复杂分布在隐空间中被压缩为低维的、结构化的表示。理想的隐空间应具备平滑性（相邻点对应相似数据）、完备性（隐空间中的任意点都能解码为合理数据）和解耦性（不同维度对应独立的语义属性）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>重要性</th>\n<th>衡量方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平滑性</td>\n<td>隐空间邻域映射到数据空间邻域</td>\n<td>插值生成自然过渡</td>\n<td>插值样本视觉质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完备性</td>\n<td>先验分布覆盖的区域均可解码</td>\n<td>避免生成垃圾样本</td>\n<td>随机采样质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解耦性</td>\n<td>单一维度变化对应单一语义</td>\n<td>精确可控生成</td>\n<td>DCI/MIG 指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紧凑性</td>\n<td>有效信息集中在低维子空间</td>\n<td>高效表示和操作</td>\n<td>方差解释比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续性</td>\n<td>语义相似的样本在隐空间中聚集</td>\n<td>支持语义检索和编辑</td>\n<td>邻域一致性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流形假说与维度选择\">流形假说与维度选择</h2><p>流形假说（Manifold Hypothesis）认为高维数据实际上分布在一个低维流形上。一张 256×256 的 RGB 图像虽然有 196608 个维度，但其中大部分组合并不对应有意义的图像。真实图像仅占据这个高维空间中一个极其狭窄的低维子集。隐空间的设计目标就是找到这个低维流形的参数化表示。</p>\n<p>维度选择是隐空间设计的关键决策。维度过低会导致信息瓶颈，丢失重要细节；维度过高则引入冗余，降低采样效率并可能损害泛化。在 VAE 中，KL 散度正则项自然地鼓励隐空间利用尽可能少的维度——未被利用的维度会坍缩到先验分布。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class ConvEncoder(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, latent_dim=512):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.conv = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(3, 64, 4, 2, 1), nn.LeakyReLU(0.2),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(64, 128, 4, 2, 1), nn.LeakyReLU(0.2),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(128, 256, 4, 2, 1), nn.LeakyReLU(0.2),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(256, 512, 4, 2, 1), nn.LeakyReLU(0.2),&#10;        )&#10;        self.fc_mu = nn.Linear(512 * 4 * 4, latent_dim)&#10;        self.fc_logvar = nn.Linear(512 * 4 * 4, latent_dim)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        h = self.conv(x).flatten(1)&#10;        return self.fc_mu(h), self.fc_logvar(h)&#10;&#10;def analyze_latent_usage(model, dataloader, latent_dim):&#10;    all_mu, all_std = [], []&#10;    for x, _ in dataloader:&#10;        mu, logvar = model.encode(x)&#10;        all_mu.append(mu.detach())&#10;        all_std.append(torch.exp(0.5 * logvar).detach())&#10;    mu_cat = torch.cat(all_mu)&#10;    std_cat = torch.cat(all_std)&#10;    active_dims = (std_cat.mean(0) &lt; 0.9).sum().item()&#10;    print(f&quot;Active dimensions: {active_dims}/{latent_dim}&quot;)&#10;    return mu_cat.var(0).sort(descending=True)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConvEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, latent_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.LeakyReLU(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.LeakyReLU(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.LeakyReLU(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.LeakyReLU(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc_mu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, latent_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc_logvar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, latent_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv(x).flatten(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc_mu(h), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fc_logvar(h)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyze_latent_usage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(model, dataloader, latent_dim):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    all_mu, all_std </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [], []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataloader:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mu, logvar </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.encode(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        all_mu.append(mu.detach())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        all_std.append(torch.exp(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logvar).detach())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mu_cat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat(all_mu)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    std_cat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat(all_std)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    active_dims </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (std_cat.mean(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).sum().item()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Active dimensions: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">active_dims</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">latent_dim</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mu_cat.var(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).sort(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">descending</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Stable Diffusion 中，隐空间由预训练的 VAE 编码器定义，将 512×512 的图像压缩为 64×64×4 的隐表示，空间压缩比为 8 倍。这个压缩率在保留足够视觉细节的同时，将扩散过程的计算量降低了约 64 倍。SDXL 和 Stable Diffusion 3 进一步优化了 VAE 架构，提升了重构质量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐空间插值与语义算术\">隐空间插值与语义算术</h2><p>隐空间的平滑性使得在两个隐向量之间进行插值可以产生有意义的中间状态。线性插值（lerp）是最简单的方法：z = (1-t)z₁ + tz₂，其中 t ∈ [0, 1]。然而当隐空间先验为高斯分布时，球面线性插值（slerp）更为合适，因为高维高斯分布的样本集中在超球面上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 插值方法&#10;        A[z₁ 猫] --&gt; L[线性插值]&#10;        B[z₂ 狗] --&gt; L&#10;        L --&gt; C[lerp 中间态]&#10;        A --&gt; S[球面插值]&#10;        B --&gt; S&#10;        S --&gt; D[slerp 中间态]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 语义算术&#10;        E[男人戴眼镜] --&gt; OP[向量运算]&#10;        F[男人] --&gt; OP&#10;        G[女人] --&gt; OP&#10;        OP --&gt; H[女人戴眼镜]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 插值方法\n        A[z₁ 猫] --&gt; L[线性插值]\n        B[z₂ 狗] --&gt; L\n        L --&gt; C[lerp 中间态]\n        A --&gt; S[球面插值]\n        B --&gt; S\n        S --&gt; D[slerp 中间态]\n    end\n    subgraph 语义算术\n        E[男人戴眼镜] --&gt; OP[向量运算]\n        F[男人] --&gt; OP\n        G[女人] --&gt; OP\n        OP --&gt; H[女人戴眼镜]\n    end</pre><p>语义算术是 Word2Vec 在隐空间中的视觉版本。经典的实验表明：z(戴眼镜男人) - z(男人) + z(女人) ≈ z(戴眼镜女人)。这说明隐空间中存在对应&quot;戴眼镜&quot;这一语义属性的方向向量，该向量独立于性别等其他属性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;&#10;def slerp(z1, z2, t):&#10;    z1_norm = z1 / z1.norm(dim=-1, keepdim=True)&#10;    z2_norm = z2 / z2.norm(dim=-1, keepdim=True)&#10;    omega = torch.acos((z1_norm * z2_norm).sum(dim=-1, keepdim=True).clamp(-1, 1))&#10;    sin_omega = torch.sin(omega)&#10;    s1 = torch.sin((1 - t) * omega) / sin_omega&#10;    s2 = torch.sin(t * omega) / sin_omega&#10;    return s1 * z1 + s2 * z2&#10;&#10;def semantic_arithmetic(encoder, decoder, img_a, img_b, img_c):&#10;    z_a = encoder(img_a)&#10;    z_b = encoder(img_b)&#10;    z_c = encoder(img_c)&#10;    z_result = z_a - z_b + z_c&#10;    return decoder(z_result)&#10;&#10;def interpolation_sequence(decoder, z1, z2, n_steps=10):&#10;    ts = torch.linspace(0, 1, n_steps)&#10;    images = []&#10;    for t in ts:&#10;        z = slerp(z1, z2, t)&#10;        images.append(decoder(z))&#10;    return torch.stack(images)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> slerp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(z1, z2, t):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z1_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z1.norm(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keepdim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z2_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z2.norm(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keepdim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    omega </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.acos((z1_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z2_norm).sum(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keepdim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).clamp(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sin_omega </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.sin(omega)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    s1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.sin((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> omega) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sin_omega</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    s2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.sin(t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> omega) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sin_omega</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> semantic_arithmetic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(encoder, decoder, img_a, img_b, img_c):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z_a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder(img_a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z_b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder(img_b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z_c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder(img_c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z_a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z_b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z_c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decoder(z_result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> interpolation_sequence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(decoder, z1, z2, n_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.linspace(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n_steps)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    images </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slerp(z1, z2, t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        images.append(decoder(z))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.stack(images)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>隐空间的线性结构并非天然存在，它依赖于模型的训练方式和正则化策略。GAN 的隐空间通常具有更好的线性解耦特性（尤其是 StyleGAN 的 W 空间），而标准 VAE 的隐空间可能存在纠缠现象。β-VAE 通过增大 KL 项系数来强制解耦，但以牺牲重构质量为代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解耦表示学习\">解耦表示学习</h2><p>解耦表示（Disentangled Representation）的目标是使隐空间的每个维度对应一个独立的语义因子。完美解耦意味着改变隐空间中的单一维度只会影响生成结果的一个语义属性，而其他属性保持不变。这种特性对于可控生成和属性编辑至关重要。</p>\n<p>β-VAE 是最具影响力的解耦方法之一。它修改 VAE 目标为 L = E[log p(x|z)] - β·KL(q(z|x) || p(z))，当 β &gt; 1 时，更强的 KL 惩罚迫使隐空间对齐各向同性高斯先验，自然地促进解耦。FactorVAE 和 β-TCVAE 进一步分解 KL 项，单独惩罚全相关（Total Correlation）以实现更精确的解耦。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>解耦策略</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>β-VAE</td>\n<td>增大 KL 惩罚</td>\n<td>简单有效</td>\n<td>β 过大损害重构质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FactorVAE</td>\n<td>惩罚全相关</td>\n<td>解耦更精确</td>\n<td>需要额外判别器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DIP-VAE</td>\n<td>协方差矩阵正则</td>\n<td>直接约束统计独立</td>\n<td>超参数敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>InfoGAN</td>\n<td>最大化互信息</td>\n<td>无需标签的 GAN 解耦</td>\n<td>训练不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 StyleGAN 中，映射网络将输入噪声 z 变换到中间隐空间 W，然后通过 AdaIN（自适应实例归一化）注入到各层。W 空间比 Z 空间具有更好的线性解耦特性。StyleGAN2 进一步引入路径长度正则化（Path Length Regularization），鼓励 W 空间中的等距移动产生等比例的图像变化，增强了隐空间的平滑性和一致性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐空间引导与条件控制\">隐空间引导与条件控制</h2><p>在条件生成中，隐空间不仅承载数据的内在表示，还需要接受外部条件信号的引导。Classifier-Free Guidance 通过在隐空间中增强条件方向来控制生成：ε_guided = ε_uncond + w·(ε_cond - ε_uncond)，其中 w 是引导强度。这等价于在隐空间中沿条件方向进行缩放，w &gt; 1 放大条件信号，生成更符合提示词的结果但牺牲多样性。</p>\n<p>文本条件通过交叉注意力机制作用于隐空间的每一层。CLIP 文本编码器将提示词转化为语义向量，这些向量在 U-Net 的每个注意力层与隐空间特征进行交叉注意力计算。不同层的交叉注意力控制不同粒度的语义——浅层影响全局构图和风格，深层影响局部细节和纹理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;def classifier_free_guidance(noise_pred_cond, noise_pred_uncond, guidance_scale=7.5):&#10;    return noise_pred_uncond + guidance_scale * (noise_pred_cond - noise_pred_uncond)&#10;&#10;def attention_map_analysis(cross_attn_maps, token_index):&#10;    attn_map = cross_attn_maps[:, :, token_index]&#10;    attn_map = attn_map.mean(dim=1)&#10;    h = w = int(attn_map.shape[-1] ** 0.5)&#10;    attn_map = attn_map.view(-1, h, w)&#10;    attn_map = F.interpolate(attn_map.unsqueeze(1), size=(512, 512), mode=&#39;bilinear&#39;)&#10;    return attn_map.squeeze(1)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> classifier_free_guidance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(noise_pred_cond, noise_pred_uncond, guidance_scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noise_pred_uncond </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> guidance_scale </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (noise_pred_cond </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noise_pred_uncond)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> attention_map_analysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cross_attn_maps, token_index):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    attn_map </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cross_attn_maps[:, :, token_index]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    attn_map </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attn_map.mean(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(attn_map.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    attn_map </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attn_map.view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, h, w)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    attn_map </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.interpolate(attn_map.unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bilinear'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attn_map.squeeze(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>隐空间编辑（Latent Space Editing）允许在不重新训练模型的情况下精确控制生成结果。Prompt-to-Prompt 通过操纵交叉注意力图实现基于文本的图像编辑；SDEdit 通过向真实图像添加噪声再去噪实现风格转换；InstructPix2Pix 训练模型直接在隐空间中根据文本指令修改图像。这些方法的共同基础是隐空间的语义结构——有意义的编辑操作对应隐空间中的有意义方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((隐空间))&#10;    流形假说&#10;      高维数据低维结构&#10;      维度选择权衡&#10;      VAE 自动维度选择&#10;    几何特性&#10;      平滑性&#10;      完备性&#10;      解耦性&#10;    操作方法&#10;      球面插值&#10;      语义算术&#10;      条件引导&#10;    应用&#10;      可控生成&#10;      图像编辑&#10;      风格迁移\">mindmap\n  root((隐空间))\n    流形假说\n      高维数据低维结构\n      维度选择权衡\n      VAE 自动维度选择\n    几何特性\n      平滑性\n      完备性\n      解耦性\n    操作方法\n      球面插值\n      语义算术\n      条件引导\n    应用\n      可控生成\n      图像编辑\n      风格迁移</pre><ul>\n<li>隐空间是连接噪声与数据的中间表示，其结构决定了生成模型的质量和可控性</li>\n<li>流形假说支持使用低维隐空间表示高维数据，维度选择需要平衡信息保留与泛化能力</li>\n<li>球面线性插值比线性插值更适合高斯先验下的隐空间操作</li>\n<li>解耦表示学习通过正则化使隐空间维度对应独立语义因子，β-VAE 是经典方法</li>\n<li>Classifier-Free Guidance 通过在隐空间中增强条件方向实现灵活的生成控制</li>\n<li>隐空间的语义结构是各种图像编辑和控制技术的理论基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"隐空间","id":"隐空间"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"流形假说与维度选择","id":"流形假说与维度选择"},{"level":2,"text":"隐空间插值与语义算术","id":"隐空间插值与语义算术"},{"level":2,"text":"解耦表示学习","id":"解耦表示学习"},{"level":2,"text":"隐空间引导与条件控制","id":"隐空间引导与条件控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"概率生成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations/probabilistic-generative-models"},"next":{"title":"生成质量评估指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/generative-foundations/evaluation-metrics"}}